1
00:00:00,280 --> 00:00:08,980
Conclusion You just read several hundred pages about why ten point seven billion people will die of preventable diseases

2
00:00:08,980 --> 00:00:15,320
while your species spends two point seven two trillion dollars a year on explosives.

3
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:21,200
Most people who read this will do nothing. The manual predicted this.

4
00:00:21,820 --> 00:00:30,460
The Moronians did exactly this. They had the math, they had the plan, they had the funding mechanism, and they went back

5
00:00:30,460 --> 00:00:36,240
to scrolling. You are currently the person Moronia warned you about.

6
00:00:36,680 --> 00:00:43,060
One action: forward The Message from the previous chapter to the most powerful person you know.

7
00:00:43,760 --> 00:00:49,020
Not a friend. Not "someone who might be interested." The most powerful person.

8
00:00:49,840 --> 00:00:56,060
Because they know someone more powerful than them, and so on, until it reaches someone who can make it happen.

9
00:00:56,640 --> 00:01:01,120
The whole plan runs on one instruction repeated: send this up.

10
00:01:02,280 --> 00:01:09,800
If you truly know nobody powerful, go to warondisease.org and vote on the one percent Treaty.

11
00:01:10,720 --> 00:01:19,580
Fifteen seconds. Your vote is personally to blame for saving thirty-eight point four lives and preventing six point nine

12
00:01:19,580 --> 00:01:25,340
million hours of suffering. If you do neither, at least admit you chose neither.

13
00:01:25,980 --> 00:01:29,960
"I didn't know" stopped being available several hundred pages ago.

14
00:01:31,060 --> 00:01:36,900
Love, Wishonia. P.S. I still can't believe you named your planet dirt.
